      "text": "The GAUSS LINKING INTEGRAL on the 3-SPHERE and in HYPERBOLIC 3-SPACE — 16 sections: Front matter; Linking integrals in S3 and H3 .; Historical background.\n\n**The GAUSS LINKING INTEGRAL on the 3-SPHERE and in HYPERBOLIC 3-SPACE**\n\n*Dennis DeTurck and Herman Gluck*\n\n40 pp, 16 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Linking integrals in S3 and H3 .; 2 Historical background.; 3 Organization of this report.; 4 Magnetic fields on S3 and H3 .; 5 Proof scheme for Theorem 2, formula (1).; 6 Proof scheme for Theorem 2, formula (2).; 7 Proof scheme for Theorem 2, formula (3).; 8 Maxwell's equations on S3 and H3 .; 9 Proof scheme for Theorem 1.; 10 Link, twist and writhe on S3 and H3 .; 11 Proof scheme for Theorem 5.; 12 Helicity of vector fields on S3 and H3 .; 13 Upper bounds for helicity in R3 , S3 and H3; 14 Spectral geometry of the curl operator in R; REFERENCES",
